  "verificationScope": "# Actual affine internal Hom and original Koszul restriction\n\nLet R be ANY ORIGINAL commutative ring. For ORIGINAL finitely presented\nM and arbitrary ORIGINAL N,construct tilde(Hom_R(M,N)) ~= internal\nHom_O(tilde M,tilde N) using PROVED quasi-coherence and the actual tilde\nadjunction. Preserve SAME ORIGINAL global Hom-section values.\nLet f:M'->M be ORIGINAL R-linear with original M,M' finitely presented.\nThen the ACTUAL sheaf-Hom identification COMMUTES with precomposition\nby the SAME f;the square is PROVED,not assumed.\n\nLet r=n+1>=1,H=(H_1,...,H_r) ORIGINAL ordered equations,I=(H),and\nK_j=exterior^j(R^r) ORIGINAL Koszul terms. ALL these terms are PROVED\nfinitely presented from the ORIGINAL finite exterior basis over ANY R.\nThen the ACTUAL original Koszul dual differential identifies with\ninternal-Hom precomposition by the SAME original tilde differential.\nThe ACTUAL internal-Hom top presentation\n Hom_O(tilde K_(r-1),tilde R) -> Hom_O(tilde K_r,tilde R)\n -> i_*O_(Spec(R/I)) -> 0\nis PROVED exact and its restriction g PROVED epi. The pinned library\nactual tildeSelf is a refl iso of this SAME tilde R with the ORIGINAL\nstructure unit. The original quotient i:Spec(R/I)->Spec R is retained.\nThe constructed term isos give an ACTUAL short-complex iso to the same\noriginal associated-dual presentation. Its last map agrees with the\nORIGINAL coefficient restriction via the proved morphism square.\n\nFor ANY ORIGINAL CommRingCat R and ORIGINAL modules M,N with ORIGINAL M FP,the ACTUAL internal Hom of their tilde sheaves is QC and actual tilde Hom_R(M,N) ~= internal Hom is CONSTRUCTED. Actual original global-section values and SAME original precomposition square are PROVED using tilde adjunction,not input compatibility. EVERY original exterior Koszul term FP is PROVED from its original finite basis over ANY R. Apply original module-map naturality to EVERY original actual exterior Koszul differential. ACTUAL internal Hom into tilde ORIGINAL R has the SAME ORIGINAL dual differential by precomposition. The pinned library tildeSelf is refl iso to ORIGINAL structure unit;this literal target avoids redundant unfolding,no replacement target or object-identification certificate. ACTUAL original internal-Hom top presentation ends in ACTUAL pushforward of ORIGINAL cut Spec R/(H) unit along original quotient;zero,actual short-complex iso,exactness,epi and restriction-map square PROVED from original dual module image/kernel computation. No regularity,field,Noetherian,smoothness,normality,CM,finite-dimensionality,Hom/QC/FP/square/exactness or quotient certificate. This actual AFFINE internal-Hom complex bridge is NOT GLOBAL original sheaf Ext,original line-bundle-frame gluing,original GLOBAL epsilon/connecting class or proper-duality. Original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,normalized theta UNVERIFIED,whole checkpoint180;all resources and oldholds unchanged.\n\nOPEN: global original line-bundle-frame gluing,GLOBAL original epsilon\nand connecting-class identification,derived SHEAF Ext/cohomology and\nproper-duality,original uniform fixed-m section production. Normalized\ntheta UNVERIFIED;original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,checkpoint180. Local affine\ninternal Hom exactness does NOT claim global a_*epsilon=a|_S.\nNo regularity,field,Noetherian,smoothness,normality,CM,finite-dimensionality\nor Hom/FP/QC/square/exactness/quotient certificate is an input.\nFailed unit-wrapper/differential elaboration attempts are NOT included as\nverified evidence. The accepted source uses literal same tilde R target,\nexisting canonical tildeSelf and proved original term finite presentation.\n\n7 root modules,378 physical lines,18 exact declarations\n(12 proofs/6 definitions);51\nclosed modules,44 byte-identical earlier frozen deps.\nAll18 full types manually read;standard3axioms only. Guarded singlecompiler\n8GiB,2threads,CPU25%,20min;all oldholds preserved. No full-project/remote\nLean CI claim. Lean4.35.0-rc3,mathlib2a885768dae569d938bb9ff3474da6a8753bb90a.\n",
